115 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 74 0 R
/E (Life is mental; we all live within a vast cosmic mind and within this vast mind are thought forms that affect how we treat other people and how they treat us in return. You can determine how other people treat you and to do this you can simply imagine other people in a positive manner. This will change their behaviour towards you. Pay attention to the mental conversations you have with other people or about other people in your mind, if they are negative, you will realize that you normally have some unexplainable negative interactions with those people. Have negative mental conversations with someone and soon you will have a negative physical interaction with that person, why? Because your mind is the cause of your life experiences. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
