endobj
139 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (You can use your own imagination and of course your mental states as well to turn your daily rejections into approvals. Rejection is one thing we normally face in our daily lives. You might apply for a job and get a call or email in return with the response that you did not get the job you wanted. You might seek a promotion in your field and fail to get it or someone else might get the promotion instead. Your business deal might not go as planned and you might end up not signing the deal you greatly wanted. You might have a business and fail to get customers. You might seek love or approach someone you have feelings for and get rejected and there are many more examples of the rejections you might face on a daily basis. These rejections are nothing more than a chance for you to understand this fact, we live in a third dimensional realm, and this realm operates through certain laws or principles, and we can apply these laws or principles to turn our rejections or failures into approvals. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
140 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (Rejection and Approval are one thing; they exist in one pole and the only difference between the two is their rates of vibration. Rejection is of a lower vibration, and it has its own mental and emotional states; we feel sad, disappointed and think apathetically when we face rejection. Approval is of a higher vibration and of course, if we get approved, we feel happy, joy, loved, secure and so on. And here is the secret: the habit of feeling great about yourself is the great secret that will get you the things you want in life. It is not about what failure you go through; it is about the mental and emotional attitude and states you are in after going through an experience. This is the most important point because it is what you will use on a daily basis if you are to experience any form of failure or rejection.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
