/P 253 0 R
/E (As soon as you are in a drowsy state, recreate the experience where you got rejected but this time around, imagine yourself being accepted or approved instead and repeat this mental exercise. Let yourself be infused by the emotions of getting what you want and of course, keep this imagined scene short and repeat it as many times as you can until you do not feel like doing it.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
